      "name": "README.md",
      "filePath": "libs/cellforge-agents/README.md",
      "summary": "Package overview for cellforge-agents, a CellForge-inspired, MassGen-style proof-of-concept in which five role-specialised agents (DataCurator, Literature, Architect, Trainer, Validator) run a propose-critique-vote loop for multi-omics perturbation modelling. Nine sections cover the agent roles and tool belts, the source layout, quick-start commands, upstream contribution paths, and the hand-off of per-round traces to the perturb-seq-eval evaluation project.",
